{
  "_about": "Open models used by the tactics AI. Each Hugging Face model is pinned to one commit and its big files to a sha256, stored under local_dir, and run on this machine only (no match data is sent anywhere). Add a model = add one entry, then: python scripts/hf_models.py fetch <name>.",
